refused: d149_no_word_on_a_whole_struct.cy:12:28, line 12 column 28
12 |     let $w: wrapped set_to $r as wrapped;
   |                            ^^
 what: `$r` is `reading`, so this says `Give` or `Copy`
 why:  `as` on a whole value says its ownership: `Give` leaves it dead, and `Copy` pays for a copy (D3, D149)
